l":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M8WHm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3bf5fbf-05e5-49fe-9d6d-67f5e566825d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"順番は不要だから辞書という話かと思っていました","ts":"1626510471.229000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MXS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f769fcb-4d04-4c9c-8910-805a6a5ab3b5","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"ちょっと話を戻しますが、設定の時にリストを使うときのメリットとして、処理される順番が確定されると言うものがありえるんじゃないかと一瞬思いましたけど、順番に処理されるメリットが思いつかない…","ts":"1626510431.228300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bOo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca0300c2-3bf6-4273-9f5e-aa2d2e3652f3","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"setに関しては良いアイデアだと思うんですけど、getについては引数でユーザー定義のdigraphだけ取得するか全部取得するか選べるようにしたいなあと思ってるので、そうなるとallを名前に入れるのはうーんとなってしまいます","ts":"1626510307.226400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YGw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9ed410e-39d4-4d7a-aedc-8c1b0d5937e0","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"主な理由はそうした方がvim9scriptでの型チェックをより厳密にできそうだから、と言うものです","ts":"1626510199.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oFBDx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"851044f9-69e9-4964-81b0-626bb258d29f","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`getalldigraphs/setalldigraphs` とかはどうでしょう？ `items` というとリストな感じがします（所感","ts":"1626510193.224500","thread_ts":"1626510193.224500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"quL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"868f25a1-0d6c-4efe-a80b-855950db1ef4","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"今は別で複数設定/取得できる関数を生やそうとしています","ts":"1626510166.223500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qb1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2da240d-2f12-48fb-87